msgid "AdvAgg JS Minify"
msgstr "AdvAgg JS 合并压缩"

msgid "AdvAgg JS Minification is disabled."
msgstr "已禁用 AdvAgg JS 合并压缩。"

msgid "Go to the <a href=\"@settings\">AdvAgg Minify JavaScript settings page</a> and select a minifier, or go to the <a href=\"@modules\">modules page</a> and disable the \"AdvAgg Minify Javascript\" module."
msgstr "转至 <a href=\"@settings\">AdvAgg 缩小 JavaScript 设置页面</a>并选择一个缩小器，或者转至<a href=\"@modules\">模块页面</a>并禁用“AdvAgg 缩小 Javascript”模块。"

msgid "AdvAgg Minify JavaScript"
msgstr "AdvAgg 合并压缩 JavaScript"

msgid "Minify JavaScript with a 3rd party minifier; JSMin+, JSMin c ext, JShrink, and JSqueeze currently."
msgstr "当前使用第三方合并压缩工具 JSMin+、JSMin c ext、JShrink 和 JSqueeze 来合并压缩 JavaScript。"

msgid "Advanced CSS/JS Aggregation"
msgstr "高级 CSS/JS 聚合"

msgid "JavaScript Minification"
msgstr "JavaScript 合并压缩"

msgid "AdvAgg JavaScript minification settings."
msgstr "AdvAgg JavaScript 合并压缩设置。"

msgid "AdvAgg: JS Minification"
msgstr "AdvAgg：JS 合并压缩"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "Add licensing information to aggregates for individual source files."
msgstr "将许可信息添加到各源文件的聚合中。"

msgid "Minifier to use. 0 is disabled."
msgstr "要使用的合并压缩工具。 0 表示已禁用。"

msgid "Upper bound comparison value for the minification ratio test."
msgstr "合并压缩比率测试的上限比较值。"

msgid "Lower bound comparison value for the minification ratio test."
msgstr "合并压缩比率测试的下限比较值。"

msgid "The jsmin function does not exist. Using JSqueeze."
msgstr "JSMin 功能不存在。 请使用 JSqueze。"

msgid "JSMin had a possible error minifying: @file, correcting."
msgstr "JSMin 合并压缩 @file 时可能遇到了一个错误，正在进行更正。"

msgid "JSMin had an error minifying file: @file, attempting to correct."
msgstr "JSMin 合并压缩文件 @file 时遇到了一个错误，正在尝试进行更正。"

msgid "The currently installed jsmin version does not handle multibyte characters, you may consider to upgrade the jsmin extension. Using JSqueeze fallback."
msgstr "当前安装的 JSMin 版本不会处理多字节字符，可以考虑升级 JSMin 扩展。 请使用 JSqueeze 回退。"

msgid "The settings below will not have any effect because AdvAgg is currently in <a href=\"@devel\">development mode</a>. Once the cache settings have been set to a non-development level, JS minification will take place."
msgstr "以下设置将不会产生任何影响，因为 AdvAgg 当前处于<a href=\"@devel\">开发方式</a>。 一旦将高速缓存设置设定为非开发级别，就将进行 JS 合并压缩。"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "已禁用"

msgid "JSMin+ ~1300ms"
msgstr "JSMin+ ~1300ms"

msgid "JShrink ~1000ms"
msgstr "JShrink ~1000ms"

msgid "JSqueeze ~600ms"
msgstr "JSqueeze ~600ms"

msgid "JSMin ~2ms"
msgstr "JSMin ~2ms"

msgid "JSMin is the very fast C complied version. Recommend using it."
msgstr "JSMin 是速度非常快的 C 编译版本。 建议使用此项。"

msgid "You can use the much faster C version of JSMin (~2ms) by installing the <a href=\"@php_jsmin\">JSMin PHP Extension</a> on this server."
msgstr "通过在此服务器上安装 <a href=\"@php_jsmin\">JSMin PHP 扩展</a>，可使用速度更快的 C 版本 JSMin (~2ms)。"

msgid "Minification: Select a minifier"
msgstr "合并压缩：选择合并压缩工具"

msgid "Add licensing comments"
msgstr "添加许可注释"

msgid ""
"If unchecked, the Advanced Aggregation module's licensing comments\n"
"      will be omitted from the aggregated files. Omitting the comments will produce somewhat better scores in\n"
"      some automated security scans but otherwise should not affect your site. These are included by default in order to better follow the spirit of the GPL by providing the source for javascript files."
msgstr ""
"如果未选中此选项，那么将在汇总文件中\n"
"省略“高级汇总”模块的许可注释。 省略注释将会在某些自动安全扫描中\n"
"产生更好的分数，但不应影响您的站点。 缺省情况下，将包含这些注释，以便能够通过提供 JavaScript 文件来源更好地遵循 GPL 的精神。"

